IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LORA-ORCH-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-CLUSTERS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOTAL-ADAPTERS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 GLOBAL-RATE         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-ORCH-V2.
    IF NUM-CLUSTERS == 0 OR TOTAL-ADAPTERS == 0 OR GLOBAL-RATE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 10400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-CLUSTERS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
